// messages
#message 1 "The year: 1993"
#message 2 "The setting: The University of Rhode Island (a.k.a. URI)"
#message 3 "\"There is a disturbance in the force.\" John states, to no one in particular."
#message 4 "\"Something is not quite right....\" John continues. "
#message 5 "\"A-HA!!!\" exclaims John."
#message 6 "\"Someone has stolen one of my precious pennies!!!\" John says. \"And I have a pretty damn good idea who did it...\""
#message 7 "\"That bastard, Ed!!!\" John screams. \"I WILL HAVE MY REVENGE!!!!\""
#message 8 "\"Hey!\" adds John. \"What the hell?? My laundry detergent is missing too!!\""
#message 9 "\"I will reclaim my penny and detergent, if it's the last thing I do!\" John states. \"By the Force, this I swear!!\""
#message 10 "Sheesh... dramatic much? Anyways... get going, you have detergent to find and revenge to take out on Ed."
#message 11 "As we begin our game, we find Jeff in his dorm room. He is just about to start off his day, but there is one small problem..."
#message 12 "His pants are missing."
#message 13 "Conveniently (for this game), all of his other pants are dirty, and there's no time to do laundry. Oh well... just another typical day in the life of a college student. Anyway... let's get going!"
#message 14 "Hey wait a minute... What's that up in the menu bar? An option called ABOUT URI QUEST. Hmm.... I wonder what that does?"
#message 15 "If you press the ESC key, a menu bar will appear, then you'll see what I'm talking about. There is also an option to bring up instructions for the game. Give it a try, why don'cha?"
#message 16 "\"Hey Jeff. Glad you could make it.\" says John, sarcastically. \"Our gig is in ten minutes. Do whatever you have to do to get ready and meet me in the lounge. See ya in a few.\""
#message 17 "\"See ya.\", you say."
#message 18 "\"Hey Ed. Jeff said you'd probably stop by.\" says John. \"Here are my car keys. Don't drive like a dick, ok?\""
#message 19 "\"I have to go practice now. Whatever you do, DON'T TOUCH ANY OF MY STUFF, or I'll have to kill you.\" John says as he leaves."
#message 20 "This is Jeff & John's dorm room. C200A, Aldrich Hall. It's pretty typical as far as dorm rooms are concerned. There are two desks, two closets, two drawers, two beds, a mirror, a push pin board and lots of other nifty crap."
#message 21 "Which one? There are two."
#message 22 "Jeff's bed is, (amazingly enough), where Jeff sleeps."
#message 23 "John's bed is, (amazingly enough), where John sleeps."
#message 24 "Jeff's mighty 486SX computer sits proudly on the desktop. Curiously, there are no books to be seen anywhere."
#message 25 "Get closer."
#message 26 "Scribbled on a piece of paper is John's music department locker combination. 8-10-22. You memorize this and put the paper back on the desk."
#message 27 "You've already memorized John's locker combination."
#message 28 "Only John would be interested in that stuff."
#message 29 "You don't need to."
#message 30 "You don't need to... yet."
#message 31 "You don't need to sit down."
#message 32 "Ordinary dorm chairs, nothing more."
#message 33 "There are some posters covering them. Jeff has a flag on his side."
#message 34 "It's a powerful 486 machine."
#message 35 "They're not important."
#message 36 "It's one of those corkboard things with push pins all over it.  Amidst the plethora of pizza delivery coupons are a couple of useful items: Jeff's schedule and a directory."
#message 37 "Jeff & John - C200A Aldrich\n\nZiggy - C200B Aldrich\n\nEd & Jeff - 416 Bressler\n\nLiz - C400A Aldrich\n\nJeff, Work - Lippitt Hall\n\nNeal - 325 Bressler\n\nJohn, Class/Work - Fine Arts"
#message 38 "Nah.  You already know where all those places are."
#message 39 "Today:\n\nSkip class\n\nGo to work\n\nskip class.\n\neat."
#message 40 "Nah.  You don't need it."
#message 41 "There are a couple of Led Zeppelin ones and John has a Van Halen one. They really aren't of much interest."
#message 42 "It's the good ole' Union Jack. Proudly displayed in honor of the many British bands who made music great."
#message 43 "It's pretty old, but it works. It's mostly used for the weekly ritual known only as 'Lois'."
#message 44 "John's beer drenched carpet covers most of the floor. Other than that, There's not much to look at."
#message 45 "My, you're a handsome devil!"
#message 46 "It's pretty nondescript."
#message 47 "It's pretty beaten up. It's also been stained one too many times by Ziggy \"I never spill anything\" Velken."
